              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "SEM (retainer)",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "Social Media Marketing (retainer)",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "Strategy Workshop (one-off)",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "Influencer Marketing (retainer)",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "I’m unclear whether I should:",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "I’m unclear whether I should:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "orderedList",
          "attrs": {
            "type": null,
            "start": 1
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "Create ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "one overarching Level 1 “Sale to Delivery” core process",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " that applies to the entire agency, and then develop Level 2 blueprints for each service,",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "or",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "or"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "orderedList",
          "attrs": {
            "type": null,
            "start": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "Create ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "separate Level 1 & 2 SOPs for each service",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " individually.",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "I’m also uncertain about Exercise 3.6 (Register Your Organization), which states to name the process:",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "I’m also uncertain about Exercise 3.6 (Register Your Organization), which states to name the process:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Sale to Delivery – Company Name – Product/Service Name",
                  "type": "text",
                  "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Sale to Delivery – Company Name – Product/Service Name"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Does this imply we are expected to create and upload a separate core process into Stage 3 for each individual service?",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Does this imply we are expected to create and upload a separate core process into Stage 3 for each individual service?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "What I’ve tried:",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ],
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "What I’ve tried:"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "text": "I’ve mapped the high-level Sale to Delivery flow for the company as a whole, but I can see how each service has its own unique delivery mechanics. That’s where I’m struggling to determine the correct structural level.",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "I’ve mapped the high-level Sale to Delivery flow for the company as a whole, but I can see how each service has its own unique delivery mechanics. That’s where I’m struggling to determine the correct structural level."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "What kind of input I’m looking for:",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ],
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "What kind of input I’m looking for:"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "text": "I’d love guidance on the ",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "I’d love guidance on the "
            },
            {
              "text": "correct structural approach",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "correct structural approach"
            },
            {
              "text": " within the EMPOWER framework.",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": " within the EMPOWER framework."
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "text": "Specifically:",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Specifically:"
